  "description": "Support package, not an SDK: most other VisioForge.DotNet.Core.Redist packages pull it in. On ARM64 there is no VideoCapture, MediaPlayer or VideoEdit redist to do that, so add it directly when the deployment guide lists it. Core DirectShow filters for the VisioForge .NET SDKs (Windows engines) on Windows ARM64: the BaseFilters set, including the color-space converters, video resizer, push video and audio sources and the built-in video processing filters, plus the audio and video bridge filters that VLC IP camera sources with a forced frame rate and separate capture with GMF mode off need.",
